{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And I too have heard.</b> A third reason for their redemption is that I have heard their groaning and their prayer in their distress." "<b>And I have remembered My covenant.</b> And by this they became worthy that I remember for them My covenant, as in: וַיַּרְא בַּצַּר לָהֶם בְּשָׁמְעוֹ אֶת רִנָּתָם, וַיִּזְכֹּר לָהֶם בְּרִיתוֹ (Psalms 106:44–45)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:33.439051601Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}